#: ops/match-color/match-color.c:64
msgid "Method"
msgstr ""

#: ops/match-color/match-color.c:65
msgid "Statistics matches each channel's mean and standard deviation, exactly like the classic editor. Monge-Kantorovich adds the 3x3 covariance so L, a and b stay correlated (no colour blotches). The +histogram variant then pulls the residuals onto the source's histogram, which catches tonal tails a linear map cannot reach"
