#: ops/reduce-noise/reduce-noise.c:53
msgid "Off: the three channels share one weight set, so colour speckle disappears without shifting hues. On: each channel is filtered on its own, which suits luminance noise only."
msgstr ""

#: ops/reduce-noise/reduce-noise.c:215
#: ops/reduce-noise/reduce-noise.c:222
