msgid "Halo suppression"
msgstr ""

#: ops/unsharp-mask/unsharp-mask.c:59
msgid "Clamp the sharpened value to the 3×3 neighbourhood of the original, in percent. At 100 the white and dark fringes along hard edges disappear; at 0 this is a plain unsharp mask."
msgstr ""

