#: ops/unsharp-mask/unsharp-mask.c:395
msgid "Unsharp Mask"
msgstr ""

#: ops/unsharp-mask/unsharp-mask.c:389
msgid "Sharpens against a blurred copy with the amount, radius and threshold of Photoshop's Unsharp Mask, plus a halo suppression stage that clamps the result to the 3×3 neighbourhood so hard edges do not grow white fringes."
msgstr ""

